  data: {
    LLM: "Count trumps. There are 8 cards per suit. If you have 5 trumps, bid. If you have 4, check your partner via signaling. Lead Aces of non-trump suits early to cash them in before they get trumped.\n\nThe 'Partner' Signal: Discard high-low to show strength. If your partner leads a suit you are void in, discard a 10 to give them points (Schummeln/Smearing).\n\nRubber Strategy: If you are at 2 points and opponents are at 20, prevent them from winning a 'Grand' or high-value game even if it costs you a simple game loss. Defensive bidding to block their strong suit is key.",
    Player: "Count trumps. There are 8 cards per suit. If you have 5 trumps, bid. If you have 4, check your partner via signaling. Lead Aces of non-trump suits early to cash them in before they get trumped.\n\nThe 'Partner' Signal: Discard high-low to show strength. If your partner leads a suit you are void in, discard a 10 to give them points (Schummeln/Smearing).\n\nRubber Strategy: If you are at 2 points and opponents are at 20, prevent them from winning a 'Grand' or high-value game even if it costs you a simple game loss. Defensive bidding to block their strong suit is key.",
